  "validation_rules": [
    "percentage_variance must be null when prior_period is zero.",
    "Amounts from different currencies cannot be combined in one record unless a documented conversion is applied.",
    "total_fees excludes financing principal, reserve holds, payouts, and bank deposits.",
    "net_payout is a transfer control and must not be added to revenue.",
    "reserve_exposure uses closing restricted balance, not cumulative reserve holds.",
    "data_confidence and reconciliation_status must reflect missing evidence.",
    "Every dashboard record must be traceable to source records through drill-down identifiers."
